# Code ownership and required-reviewer governance. GitHub requires a review from
# a matching owner before a PR can merge when branch protection has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled — the human gate on infrastructure
# change. Replace the placeholder team/handles with your own.
#
# Format: <path pattern>   <owner> [<owner> ...]

# Default owner for everything.
*                       @your-org/platform-engineering

# Pipeline, policy, and agent config are higher-trust — require the platform team.
/.github/                @your-org/platform-engineering
/policy/                 @your-org/platform-engineering @your-org/security
/infra/backend.hcl.example   @your-org/platform-engineering

# Security guardrails: require a security review on any policy change.
/policy/deny_public_network_access.rego   @your-org/security
/policy/require_secure_transport.rego     @your-org/security
/policy/allowed_subs_per_env.rego         @your-org/security
